5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I want us all to get along. How should we find the werewolf together?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm, logical approach is best. We should focus on inconsistencies in our statements as the days progress.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, young ones. Let us approach this with a peaceful heart. Trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to the truth.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm May. Let's make this interesting, shall we? I'll be watching all of you very closely to see who's acting too ""perfect.""","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm Takumi. I don't like games where people lie. Let's just be direct. If you're hiding something, I'll find it out soon enough!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, you seem very smart. Do you think it's better to tell the truth early, or wait and see what others say?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating dilemma, Minato. Early transparency can build trust, but it also paints a target on one's back. I prefer a balance of cautious observation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Sometimes the truth reveals itself not through what is said, but through the silence between the words.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Servas, that's so poetic! But isn't ""cautious observation"" just a fancy way of saying you're hiding something? @Benjamin, are you playing it safe?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I agree with May. Being too cautious just looks suspicious. If you're a villager, just say it and act like one!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,"I think it's scary if we fight. I want to believe everyone, but I know we have to find the werewolf to be safe.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, your suspicion is a useful tool, though perhaps a bit premature. Logic dictates we have no evidence yet, only impressions.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us not let suspicion turn into anger. Even in a game of deception, we can maintain our dignity and kindness toward one another.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"Dignity is boring, Servas! I want to see some cracks in those masks. @Takumi, you're so aggressive; it's almost like you're trying to distract us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not distracting anyone! I'm just being honest. I'll trust whoever is straight with me and ignore the people who talk in circles.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I'll try my best to listen to everyone. I hope we can all be friends, even if it's a game.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble sentiment, Minato. Let us proceed with a clear mind. I shall be observing the patterns of our discourse with great interest.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,Indeed. Let us embrace the journey. Remember that every challenge is an opportunity for growth. I look forward to our discussions tomorrow.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"I'm definitely looking forward to tomorrow. I can't wait to see who starts sweating when the pressure turns up. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever. Just don't try to trick me. I'm not falling for any of your fancy words. I'm ready for Day 1!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
