31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well. Does anyone have any thoughts on who might be the werewolf?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning. I've been reflecting on yesterday's interactions. Takumi's aggression is notable, though it could be a simple personality trait.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"The morning sun brings clarity. I feel a sense of harmony among us, though I sense some of you are troubled by doubt.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Morning! @Minato, you're so sweet, it's almost suspicious. Are you playing the ""innocent"" role to make us lower our guards?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop picking on Minato. He's just being nice. You're the one trying to stir up trouble for no reason. That's what a werewolf would do.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I'm not trying to trick you... I just want us to be happy. I'm sorry if I seem strange.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your defense of Minato is interesting. It shows a protective instinct, or perhaps a strategic alliance. Let us analyze the logic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is beautiful to see Takumi protecting another. Kindness is the strongest shield we have, even in the face of deception.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, look at you, playing the hero! It's almost too cute. Tell me, are you and Minato working together, or are you just trying to look like a ""good guy""?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not ""playing"" anything! I just hate it when people are mean for no reason. May, you're acting way too much like a Possessed trying to confuse us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,I don't want anyone to be mean. Maybe we should listen to Benjamin? He seems to know how to think about this.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the trust, Minato. Currently, May's tendency to provoke others is the most disruptive element, though not necessarily proof of guilt.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us breathe and find our center. If we act in haste, we may cast out a friend. Let us consider the evidence with a calm spirit.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, now you're joining in? I'm just shaking the tree to see what falls out! If I were the werewolf, I'd be acting as boring as Servas.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, if you're a villager, then you should agree with me. May is the most suspicious one here. She's just trying to deflect everything.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm a little scared now... I don't want to vote for the wrong person. But I think May is being a bit too loud.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"While May is provocative, we must be careful. However, based on the current flow of conversation, she is the most logical candidate for scrutiny.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy burden to decide the fate of another. Let us cast our votes not with hatred, but with the hope of saving our village.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"Wow, you're all turning on me just because I'm the life of the party? How predictable! Go ahead, vote for me, and see how wrong you are.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm done talking. May is definitely the one. She's trying to act like it's a joke, but she's just hiding. I'm voting for her.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
