64,2,1,talk,Minato,,Oh no... Benjamin is gone. I can't believe it. Who would do something so mean?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Life is a fleeting shadow, and Benjamin's departure reminds us of our own fragility. We must remain strong for his sake.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Damn it! We got May, but the werewolf is still here and they took out the smartest guy we had. This is getting serious.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you look so angry. Do you think the werewolf is one of us? I'm really scared now.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Fear is a cloud that obscures the sun, Minato. Let us look past the fear and see who remains. We are still together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Of course the werewolf is one of us! It's either Minato or Servas. Servas is being way too calm, it's creepy.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, why me? I've been trying to be nice... I don't understand why you're saying that.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, it is natural to seek a target when we are grieving. But remember, a calm sea does not mean there is no depth.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"That's exactly what a werewolf would say! ""I'm just a calm sea."" Give me a break. Servas, tell me exactly why you're not the wolf.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think Servas is a good person. He's always so kind to me. I don't think he would hurt anyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I only wish for the peace of this village. If my composure brings you doubt, then I shall accept that burden with a smile.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"Minato, you're too naive. That's how they get you. Servas is acting like a saint to make you trust him. I'm voting for him.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
